From ed30961170197da8a7944a6d8c7e08f64c6a2db3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Justin <justurn@live.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 00:17:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: sell loot before training, camp brake by deaths, back
 out to rest, Victory Rush (F-219)

- interact.vendor_sell (CMSG_SELL_ITEM; AC answers only a failure)
- runner sells greys/spare gear at the nearest area vendor each level BEFORE the trainer and
  instead of destroying when bags fill (Northshire's level-6 warrior had 102c, no Thunder Clap)
- every death's spot is recorded (defends too); 3 at one camp at our level park the quest a level
- hurt below 60 % after a camp kill: walk out past the camp edge before resting
- Victory Rush in the warrior rotation; food keeps 3s back for the trainer

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SQmFdwZBdZ1kNkYTTF4JNJ
